# Trivy CVE exceptions for orkyo-foundation
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # Impact | Reason | Added: YYYY-MM-DD | Review: YYYY-MM-DD
#
# Policy: time-bound only. Review date must be within 14 days of added date.
# Remove entries once the upstream fix is available.
#
# Reviewed 2026-10-01: The 26.7.5 pin cleared five vulnerable-library exceptions:
# Bouncy Castle (1.86), netty (4.1.138), FreeMarker (2.3.35), and Jackson (2.21.7).
# Jackson also closed CVE-2026-91776/91777, published 2026-10-01. The `mssql-jdbc`
# false-positive exception was dropped on 2026-10-16: the 26.8.0 pin ships 13.4.0.jre11.
# Git history contains the review narrative.
